r ticket SWT-A77E60CB2CB9, please do the next step below and reply with what you see (for example the lights, the screen message or whether it prints).", "section_id": null, "at": null}, {"kind": "step", "text": "3. **Restart POS Application**\n   - Close ServeWell POS completely\n   - Wait 10 seconds\n   - Reopen ServeWell POS and check if printer status updates to \"Online\"", "section_id": "runbooks/printer-offline.md#immediate-steps-first-2-minutes", "at": null}, {"kind": "summary", "text": "Hi, ticket SWT-A77E60CB2CB9 is resolved. What was done:\n1. Physical check of power and cable: done at the store.\n2. Printer self-test: done at the store.\n3. Restart of the POS application: done at the store.\nIf the problem comes back, reply here and we will reopen it.", "section_id": null, "at": null}], "actions": [], "outcome": {"route": "resolver", "triage_route": "l1_guided", "status": "resolved", "handoff_reason": null, "priority": "P3", "llm_calls": 7, "tokens": 74222, "cost_usd": 0.005684}, "walk": {"runbook_id": "runbooks/printer-offline.md", "kb_rev": "kb-376ed63bddb652dd", "end": "fixed", "end_reason": "The latest store reply confirms the printer is online and working now.", "steps": [{"turn": 1, "step_id": "po-physical-check", "kind": "store", "action_id": null, "outcome": "replied", "result": "I verified the printer is powered on, but the POS still shows it offline and it isn\u2019t printing orders."}, {"turn": 2, "step_id": "po-self-test", "kind": "store", "action_id": null, "outcome": "replied", "result": "I held FEED for a self-test and it printed successfully, but the POS still reports the printer offline and orders don\u2019t print."}, {"turn": 3, "step_id": "po-restart-pos-app", "kind": "store", "action_id": null, "outcome": "replied", "result": "I closed ServeWell POS, waited 10 seconds, and reopened it; the printer is online and working now."}], "tried": []}, "audit_summary": {"events": 87, "by_step": {"api:api.create_ticket:accepted": 1, "itsm:create_